  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = (√5 + 1)/(√5 - 1) and y = (√5 - 1)/(√5 + 1)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n(x + y)2 = x2 + y2 + 2xy\n\n⇒ x2 + y² = (x + y)2 - 2xy\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nxy = (√5 + 1)/(√5 - 1) × (√5 - 1)/(√5 + 1) = 1\n\nx + y = (√5 + 1)/(√5 - 1) + (√5 - 1)/(√5 + 1) = (√5 + 1)/(√5 - 1) + (√5 - 1)/(√5 + 1) \n\n= [5 + 1 + 2√5 + 5 + 1 - 2√5]/[5 - 1]\n\n= 12/4\n\n= 3\n\nPutting values in x2 + y2 = (x + y)2 - 2xy, we get x2 + y2 = 3² - 2 × 1 = 7\n\n∴ x2 + y2 – 4 = 7 - 4 = 3\n\n191:T1250,\n\n<strong",
